WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.219 --> 00:00:07.518
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1 b

2
00:00:08.258 --> 00:00:15.176
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I always get up at 7.00 during the week. I start work at 8.00 every day.

3
00:00:17.675 --> 00:00:19.814
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2 a

4
00:00:20.694 --> 00:00:26.053
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I often go to the cinema after work. About seven or eight times a month.

5
00:00:28.612 --> 00:00:30.911
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3 c

6
00:00:31.511 --> 00:00:36.869
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I usually finish work at 6.00. But on Fridays we stop at 3.00.

7
00:00:39.349 --> 00:00:41.708
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4 f

8
00:00:42.188 --> 00:00:46.287
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I sometimes meet a friend for lunch. About once or twice a month.

9
00:00:48.686 --> 00:00:51.285
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5 e

10
00:00:51.905 --> 00:00:56.984
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I hardly ever go to the theatre. Only once or twice a year.

11
00:00:59.123 --> 00:01:01.842
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6 d

12
00:01:02.442 --> 00:01:05.921
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I never have coffee. I don’t like it.